'' T15, RUN: 'for each w as ustring' over a 'string' array converts each word. fbc-modern
'' prints these four lines; the old tiko printed a length of 2 and a code unit of 0 for
'' "ab", made three distinct keys of three words, and put "cafe" at length 5.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc tests/mir/src/foreach-ustring-run.bas -o tests/mir/foreachustringrun.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/mir/foreachustringrun.exe
'' RUN: tests/mir/foreachustringrun.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  2 98
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  4 233
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: distinct 2
